@startuml
title Releasing a version
|Developer|
start
:Merge the last change;
:Tag the version;
|CI|
:Build and test;
if (all green?) then (yes)
  :Publish packages;
  fork
    :Upload to the registry;
  fork again
    :Build the website;
  end fork
else (no)
  |Developer|
  :Fix and tag again;
  stop
endif
|Developer|
:Write the release notes;
stop
@enduml
